WEBVTT

00:03:59.944 --> 00:04:02.007
But that's not actually what happens.

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:04.240
You know?

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:08.250
That bottle winds up getting burned.

00:04:09.417 --> 00:04:13.039
The recycling of plastic
in many developing countries

00:04:13.063 --> 00:04:16.213
means the incineration of the plastic,
the burning of the plastic,

00:04:16.237 --> 00:04:18.663
which releases incredible toxic chemicals

00:04:18.687 --> 00:04:20.520
and, once again, kills people.

00:04:20.544 --> 00:04:24.264
And so, poor people
who are making these products

00:04:24.288 --> 00:04:27.050
in petrochemical centers
like Cancer Alley,

00:04:27.074 --> 00:04:30.152
poor people who are consuming
these products disproportionately,